= Serannus Plan Ratified

The Serannus Plan is finally ratified, and with that, the main reason President DuFour and the [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: propertied right?] has even considered governing with us. Chancellor [+ chancellor +] is likely to enact a sweeping reform of Commonwealth finances in order to make the payments, likely including cuts to social spending. With the War Loans eased, the question of rearmament — long forbidden — has quietly returned to the national conversation.

- @joever: If this year couldn't get any worse...

@joever

This is outside of our control.